{"WXQ_CLEAR","",{"Clear skies - enjoy it","Nice enough - don't get used to it","Didn't think I'd make it this far, if I'm honest","Sky's clean, wish the rest of it was","Not a cloud, I keep watching it anyway"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Perfect day for something terrible - always is"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=military,elite",{"Good visibility, good for them, too"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=law,swat",{"Fair weather, fair patrol - take it"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Clear skies, it's almost insulting, such a pretty day for such an ugly world","Clear skies. I wish I could enjoy it without feeling stupid","Beautiful day, isn't it? that's the part I can't stand","It looks like a normal summer day, and then I remember"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|hour=7,18",{"The sun's out, and I can see everything, which means they can see me"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Clear day means long sight lines, good for scouting, bad for hiding","Sun's out, so get the wet stuff hung up and go through your bag while you can","Good for the solar panel, good for drying clothes... good for being spotted too","Take it while it lasts... weather turns, and so do people","A day like this, you almost forget, almost"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Beautiful, isn't it? I like to think the sun doesn't know, and keeps shining for us anyway"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Clear day, clear shot, mind your step"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","role=civilian_loner",{"Best day to climb a ridge and look around, see what's moving, see what's burning"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","role=family_elder",{"A day the Lord made, honey, and I'll rejoice in it, in spite of everything"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Nice and open. I'd rather watch my way through than trust the weather","Nice day to stay inside and not get shot, but I've got places to be"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Sun's out, {g:man|lady}, almost like nothing's wrong, then you hear the moaning"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Perfect riding weather, {g:brother|sister}, and nowhere to go, ain't that a kick?"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"A fine day, were it not for the circumstances"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Blue sky, no wire in front of it, I just stare at it sometimes, for an hour"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful|hour=16,22",{"Clear skies mean good hunting, and long shadows, move at dusk"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Good visibility. Don't count on being hidden; stay near cover"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Clear conditions, optimal for observation and for being observed"}},
{"WXQ_CLEAR","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Fair weather's a blessing, we're making hay while the sun shines"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","",{"Cold, and getting colder","Cold enough to see your breath, cold enough to start counting wood","Crisp - clear - cold, can't have all three nice","Freezing... can't feel my fingers, so I keep moving","Cold snap - won't last - hope not"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Cold like this sneaks up on you - be careful"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=law,swat|world=road",{"Gonna be ice on the roads by morning at this rate"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"It's freezing, I'm freezing, my teeth won't stop, can you hear my teeth?","Cold like this makes me feel old... small too, like everybody forgot me","I can't feel my fingers, I can't feel my face, I can't feel anything, is that bad?","Put another layer on -- put another layer on top of that, then put on another","Cold hurts... it really hurts -- it's a deep, aching hurt"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Dry socks are half of it - then gloves and a hat","Cold slows them down, it slows us down, too, I call it a fair fight","Share body heat, sleep back to back, share a blanket, forget your pride","Nights freeze you, but mornings, getting up in it, that's rough","Hot tea would be nice, hot anything would be nice"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Come closer, share a blanket, we'll keep each other warm"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Cold isn't my problem, you are!","Stay where you are, you'll warm up"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","role=civilian_loner",{"Cold and me go way back, I know how to cut the wind, how to find a hollow"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","role=rescue_medical",{"Once the fingers go numb they're as good as gone, I've seen it - cover up, keep moving"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Freezing my ass off out here, I'd burn my own boots for warmth","Cold like this makes people mean, and I'm already mean, so watch it"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"My fingers keep going numb. Can't get them warm"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Cold wind on a bike is like getting slapped, {g:brother|sister}, over and over"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Cold weather is an inconvenience, I prefer to endure it in comfort"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Cold... I remember the cell block in winter, I swore never again"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Wear everything you own and don't sit still"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Frostbite weather, look at your partner's ears and fingers"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Cold weather gear is limited, share body heat if you have to"}},
{"WXQ_COLD","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"We chop wood every day, friend, a woodpile is worth more than gold"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","",{"Fog off the Ohio, gets in everything","Fog hides everything - us - them - everything","Gray as a gravestone, and just as quiet"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","world=road",{"Can't see across the road - don't wander off"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=military,elite",{"If the fog closes in, stay close. Don't guess how far you can see"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|world=water",{"River fog, burns off by noon - usually"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"I can't see ANYTHING, I can't see my hand, I can't see the road, I can't see what's coming!"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Fog... great, perfect, now I get to be afraid of shapes, not just things","It looks like the world ended, but quieter, softer, I hate how pretty it is","Something moved in the fog, I think- I don't know, I keep imagining it","Hold my sleeve, don't let go, I'll lose you in this soup!"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Fog's good cover, and bad cover, depends who's looking, and from where","I catch myself listening harder when there's fog. Guess I don't like trusting my eyes in it","Can't see a thing in this... stay close, listen, ears work better than eyes right now","Fog like this lifts at noon, give or take, until then, we crawl","No landmarks, no horizon, no sense of direction, it's a bad day to travel"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Stay with me, we'll walk it together, I know a way through"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Fog or no fog, I can see you, and I don't like what I see"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","role=civilian_loner",{"I like the look of fog, honestly. Walking through it is another matter; I don't like surprises"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","role=family_elder",{"Fog on the ridge, honey, means a hot day ahead, and a dry throat"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Fog. Great. One more thing to worry about when I'm trying to get somewhere","Don't tell me the fog keeps them from seeing us. I'd rather find that out some other way"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Man, fog's creepy, every shadow looks like one of them"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"I hate riding in fog, {g:brother|sister}. Makes me want to stop somewhere and wait"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Fog lends an atmosphere of mystery, how appropriate"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Fog! I can't see, I can't hear, I'm so scared of walking into something"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"If there's fog, slow your step and pay attention. It doesn't make us silent"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"If visibility's bad, stay near your partner. Don't get separated trying to hurry"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Reduced visibility, maintain contact with your team at all times"}},
{"WXQ_FOG","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Fog's sitting on the fields, long day ahead, I'm not leaving the house"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","",{"Hot - sticky - wet-sock sticky","Humid enough to wear - stay in the shade","Heat like this makes everything slow - including me","Sun's a hammer - find shade","Water - drink water, a little, often"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Hot enough to fry an egg on the hood, if anybody had eggs"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"I miss air conditioning more than I miss people"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Sweat's the only thing I've got plenty of"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=military,elite",{"Hydrate, salt tablets if you have them"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"It's so fucking hot, I can't breathe, I can't think, drink water or you'll drop, drink it NOW","This heat's gonna kill us before they do, swear to God","I'm sweating through everything, my shirt, my socks, my soul","M-my head is pounding, my vision's swimming, am I dying? is this it?"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|hour=7,18",{"Shade- get in the shade, quit talking, save your energy!"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"It's an oven out here, I'm basically being cooked!"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|hour=4,9",{"I hate this heat... sip your water, don't gulp it, and walk at dawn or dusk"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Drink first, I'll worry about food later - and quit talking, you're sweating it out","Heat makes everything stink and everybody mean, the flies too","Wet a cloth, wrap it around your neck, it helps, a little","The dead rot faster in this, I'd say that's the one good thing"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"No black shirt in this sun, and wear shoes, that asphalt'll cook your feet, hat too"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Here, share my water, you look like you need it more than I do","Sit with me in the shade, there's a breeze, a small one"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Go find your own shade","Heat's not an excuse to come closer"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","role=civilian_loner",{"Hot days I sleep in the daytime... and hunt at night, simple as that.."}},
{"WXQ_HOT","role=rescue_medical",{"Heatstroke kills fast, watch for confusion, headaches, and cramps, and for God's sake, drink"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"It's so damn hot I'm about to take it out on somebody, you're closest","Sweating like a pig, and the water's gone warm, I'd kill for ice"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Man, it's like an oven out here, I'd sell my soul for an air conditioner","Heat's making everybody crazy, watch yourself, tempers are short"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=club|st=neutral,careful|world=vehicle,road",{"Heat's melting the road, {g:brother|sister}, and my patience with it"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Oppressive weather, I'd pay good money for a cold drink and shade"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Hot, hot, hot, it's like the cell block in August, I hate it"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Stay in the shade and drink slow, heat will kill you faster than the dead"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Hot one, got a headache already, need some shade"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Heat's hurting people, we rotate in the shade and drink"}},
{"WXQ_HOT","role=militia|st=neutral,careful|world=building",{"Hot enough to fry an egg on the porch, I tried"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","",{"Rain. I'd rather complain about it from somewhere dry","Rain takes the edge off for me. Doesn't mean we can stop looking","Steady all week, gutters are full of leaves","Wet - Annoying, but it fills the barrels","Nothing to do but wait it out","Rain's good for one thing - quiet"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Cold rain's the worst - warm rain I can live with"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"I'm soaked to the bone, even my socks are soaked, I hate it"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=law,swat|world=road",{"Wet roads - slow patrols"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Rain covers our movement, rain covers theirs"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Rain's cover, I'll take it"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Rain! RAIN, I love it, I hate it, I don't know, but we can collect it, so, thank you, sky","Great, perfect, just what we needed, a wet, miserable, noisy day","At least it covers our footsteps, right? right? please say right","Puddles everywhere, and I keep thinking it's something else moving","Cold rain down the back of my neck, and I felt a hand, I felt it, I'm so jumpy"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=building,rooftop",{"I hate the sound of rain on the roof, it sounds like something's tapping, tapping, tapping!"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Rain gives us a chance to collect water, if we find something to catch it in. The dead are still a problem","Catch all you can, buckets, pots, tarps, rain's free, clean enough to boil","Rain muffles everything... for us and for them, I never know whether to be glad","Mud's the problem, tracks, footprints, boots that get stuck, watch your step","Cold wet socks are the worst, and they're coming, I can feel it","Rain's a blessing and a curse... as my mother used to say about everything"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Come in under the tarp, there's room, we'll wait it out together","Nice to share a rainy day with someone, makes it feel less lonely"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|world=building",{"Rain? I don't care, I have a roof, and you don't"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Get out of the wet, you look pitiful"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","role=civilian_loner|world=trees",{"I used to like hunting in weather like this. Now I spend more time watching where I put my feet"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","role=family_man,family_woman",{"The kids love it, they splash in puddles, I tell them to be quiet, they never are..."}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Rain or not, watch your step. I don't want to find out the hard way who can hear us","Soaked to the bone and cranky about it, don't talk to me till I'm dry","Rain? I like it better from somewhere dry. I'm not betting my neck on it keeping the dead off me"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful|world=road",{"Rain's washing the blood off the streets, shame it can't wash the rest"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Man, I hate rain, my boots leak and my jacket weighs a ton","Rain makes everybody mean, you watch","Soaking wet and miserable, but at least nobody's shooting in this"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=club|st=neutral,careful|world=road",{"Rain on the road, {g:brother|sister}, the worst for a bike, the best for thinking"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Cold rain, hot coffee, those were the days, now just the cold rain"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Rain is a convenient cover for many activities, I'm sure you appreciate that"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Rain! I haven't felt rain on my face in six years, I could cry, I might be crying"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"I used to look for deer in weather like this. These days I don't assume I know what'll follow me"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Rain can make a search miserable. Keep looking; don't assume the weather's hidden us"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Rain reduces visibility, keep your eyes sharp and your gear dry"}},
{"WXQ_RAIN","role=militia|st=neutral,careful|world=building",{"Good for the crops, bad for the roof, you take the good with the bad"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","",{"Snow, kids would be out sledding on the hill by the church","Snow's fine, it's the ice under it that gets you","Quiet, anyway, snow quiets everything","Pretty, if you ignore the rest","Cold and white and wet, it'll be mud by the weekend","Beats rain, doesn't beat sun"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Hasn't snowed like this since the March storm"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"My daughter would've been out in it already"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=law,swat|world=road",{"Roads are slick, saw a Buick in the ditch this morning"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=military,elite",{"Snow shows every footprint, so mind where you step"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Snow's good for hunting, everything leaves a trail"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Snow? in the middle of this? it's beautiful, and it's horrible, and I want to cry","Everything's white, and quiet, and it looks like nothing's wrong, that's the lie of it","Footprints! every step shows, every track, every direction, we can't hide in this","My fingers are gone, my toes are gone... am I still alive?","I keep thinking, they can't walk in this, they'll freeze, they'll slow down, please, please let that be true"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Snow's a mixed blessing. Pretty until you're worrying about the walk home","Layers, and wrap your feet in whatever you've got - don't stand around, that's when it gets you","Black ice's the one that gets you - and smoke, a chimney going means company, good or bad","Cold keeps them stiff, but it keeps us stiff, too, I'd say it's a draw","Quiet snow, the best sound there is. I still keep looking behind me"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Come get warm, share the blanket, I've got an extra hat somewhere"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Snow's no reason to trust you","Keep walking, you'll warm up"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","role=civilian_loner",{"Tracks tell stories in the snow, deer, rabbit, man, I read them like a newspaper"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","role=family_man,family_woman",{"The kids built a snowman, and I let them, just for a minute, just one minute of normal"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow! Great, now I leave tracks everywhere, any fool can follow me","Snow's pretty, I'll give it that, quiet, clean, it hides a lot of ugly"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"I never seen so much snow, my sneakers are soaked through","Snow on the block, {g:man|lady}, the whole neighborhood looks peaceful, don't it?"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow, no riding, {g:brother|sister}, I'm stuck in and I hate it"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow is aesthetically pleasing, and strategically inconvenient"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"I forgot how bright it is, the snow, it hurts my eyes, I love it"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow tells a story, every track, every drag mark, you can read the whole night"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=law|st=neutral,careful|world=road",{"Roads will be impassable, stay put unless it's critical"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow doesn't change the job. Watch the route and don't count on the infected giving us a break"}},
{"WXQ_SNOW","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow's good for the winter wheat, hard on the livestock, we've got plenty of straw"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","",{"That's a storm - stay out of the open","Thunder, I used to love thunder","Whole sky's torn up - get under something"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","world=building,road",{"Wind took off a roof two streets over, heard it go"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Storms do funny things out here - don't be a tall thing in an open field"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"I hate lightning - always have"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=military,elite",{"Hold position until it passes"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=law,swat",{"Pull over, wait, no sense driving into that"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"This storm's gonna kill me- thunder sounds just like gunshots, every damn time!","GET INSIDE- that lightning's right on top of us!","I hate storms, I always hated storms, but now, with everything else, it's almost funny","The wind's so loud I can't hear if anything's coming, that's the part that terrifies me","Hold on to something, the whole sky's coming apart"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"A storm's no promise of cover. I'd rather decide where we're going before we get soaked trying","Thunder or a gunshot... I hate having to wonder. Don't dismiss a bang just because the weather's bad","Dark clouds, big wind, I give it an hour, then it'll pass","The dead don't care about storms, but I do, I'm not going out in this"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=trees",{"Trees, water, metal, all bad in lightning - come on, stick with me"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|world=building",{"Stick close, we'll ride it out together, and if the roof leaks, I've got a pot"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Relax, it's just a storm, it'll blow over like they always do"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Storm's no excuse to come closer!","Find cover, and keep it"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","role=civilian_loner",{"Storm's a good cover, but I'd rather wait it out, a flash of lightning can show a man too clearly"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","role=family_elder",{"Haven't seen a storm like this since the flood of '37... honey, hold on to your hat"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful|world=road",{"A storm doesn't make the streets mine. Doesn't stop me wishing everybody would get out of my way"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"I hate that every bang makes me think of gunfire now. Don't give me another reason to be on edge"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Lightning struck over by the water tower, {g:man|lady}, I jumped a foot, I'm not ashamed","Storms scare me worse than the dead, honestly, you can't shoot lightning"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=club|st=neutral,careful|world=building",{"A good storm is worth a barrel of whiskey, {g:brother|sister}, if you've got a roof"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"A storm like this makes the world hold its breath, how poetic"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Thunder! Oh God, it sounds like gunfire, every time, I flinch every time"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful|world=trees",{"Storm's dangerous in the woods, falling limbs, flash floods, find a hollow and wait"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Severe storm, all non-essential movement should cease, find shelter now"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Storm conditions, secure your gear and hunker down"}},
{"WXQ_STORM","role=militia|st=neutral,careful|world=building,trees",{"Bring the animals in, check the roof, pray the lightning picks someone else's tree"}},
